Placement seems to be fairly regular.

Destination before origin; as in klama.
Container before contained objects (hinted at by the fact that they're
'container' gismu); as in tanxe, bakfu, dakli.
If there is an agent of the action then it comes early, whatever the action
is being performed on comes after; look at cusku, tavla.
People, animals, objects and the like generally come before information
unless the information is part of the action or is significantly more
important than the people; see dunda, ckule, vecnu.

Just a couple, hopefully others have more.

Hugglesworth.

